## Aurum

The speech engine is **Aurum** (https://github.com/joe-broadhead/aurum), Copyright (c) 2026 Joe Broadhead, MIT. It is not
bundled in this package: each GitHub release of this plugin carries the pinned binary for each platform, gzipped, with its
own `LICENSE.aurum`, and `manifest/aurum.json` names the pin.

## Speech models

No model is shipped or bundled. The model manifest (`manifest/models.json`) records each file's source, exact size,
SHA-256, revision and licence; the cache stores them beside the file:

- Whisper ggml weights: MIT (whisper.cpp weights, OpenAI Whisper terms).
- Kitten TTS nano 0.8 int8 (model, voices, config): Apache-2.0.

A model's licence text ships with the model in the cache, not in this package.
